        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" ezremote:id="248" ezremote:identifier="body" name="Body" type="ezxmltext">
          <section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/">
            <section>
              <section>
                <header>One installation, many sites</header>
                <paragraph>Siteaccesses give each site, language or channel its own address, design and settings while sharing the same content repository. A brand site, a campaign microsite and an intranet can live together and reuse what they have in common.</paragraph>
              </section>
              <section>
                <header>Translations that stay in sync</header>
                <paragraph>Every field can be translated. Editors see the original next to the translation, fallbacks keep pages complete while translations are on their way, and each language can be published on its own schedule.</paragraph>
              </section>
            </section>
          </section>
